  "instructions": [
    "If using satay marinade , combine ingredients , and marinate meat at least 2 hours in the refrigerator",
    "Sprinkle carrot and daikon with salt and 1 teaspoon of the sugar and toss with fingers",
    "Let sit about 3 minutes , until softened",
    "Rinse and drain",
    "Mix vinegar , water , and 1 tablespoon of sugar",
    "Add carrot and daikon , and let marinate at least 1 hour in the refrigerator",
    "Grill meat until done and slice",
    "Lightly toast bread",
    "Spread lightly with mayonnaise and sprinkle on soy sauce",
    "Fill with cilantro , carrot , daikon , cucumber , meat and jalapeno",
    "Close and enjoy !"
